WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:04.546
FieldFleet is a field operations platform for restoration, construction,

2
00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:08.958
and trade contractors. One workspace for the whole job.

3
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.979
Your day opens with a summary: what's urgent,

4
00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:14.792
what's due, and where your crews are booked.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.325
Every project, from first inspection to close-out. Status,

6
00:00:19.325 --> 00:00:23.650
task progress, approved value, profit, and margin, at a glance.

7
00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:27.717
Open a job and the numbers are already there:

8
00:00:27.717 --> 00:00:31.567
contract amount, approved value, profit, markups, and the timeline.

9
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.425
Work breaks into tasks by phase, assigned to crews, with overdue items flagged.

10
00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:44.083
One click turns the same tasks into a schedule: durations, dependencies, and today's line.

11
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.662
Customers, contacts, and vendors stay connected to the work,

12
00:00:47.662 --> 00:00:51.025
with scoped portals for clients and subs.

13
00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:57.183
Field forms, time tracking, inventory, and reporting are built in, not bolted on.

14
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.700
FieldFleet is source-available under the Elastic License 2.0.

15
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:06.000
Self-host it free. Powered by TaskFleet AI.
